OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader voted out after no
OL,4,Aconfidence motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has been voted out
OL,7,Ffollowing a motion of no confidence.
OL,9,FJeremy Hilton, of Gloucester City
OL,10,FCouncil, lost a motion of no confidence
OL,11,Fby 21 votes to 18 on Thursday evening.
OL,12,FHe then failed to win a second vote to
OL,13,Freinstate him to the position, in a
OL,14,Fmove branded "crazy" and a "farce" by
OL,15,Fopposition councillors.
OL,17,FThe Liberal Democrat, who has run a
OL,18,Fminority administration on the council
OL,19,Ffor two years, said the council had a
OL,20,F"toxic atmosphere".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
