OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader voted out after no
OL,4,Aconfidence motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority has been left with no
OL,7,Fleader or cabinet after all seven
OL,8,Fmembers resigned en-masse following the
OL,9,Fvotes but it has told residents its
OL,10,Fservices will not be affected.
